<p>Call upon nature to regenerate your body for <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>Constitution 10, 25, 50, 75, 100,<br>Willpower 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">12, 21, 36, 51, 66</acronym> life every turn and increase healing mod by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">14%, 20%, 24%, 27%, 30%</acronym> for 8 turns.</p><p>The life healed will increase with your Willpower or Constitution (whichever is higher).</p>